WEBVTT

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:04.640
<i>Wash them.</i>

00:00:05.170 --> 00:00:07.860
Always.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.340
<i>I wash them...</i>

00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:16.570
I always wash my hands before riding you.

00:00:20.890 --> 00:00:26.640
When I touch you with the honed nerves 
of my hands, I see right through you.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:28.420
I understand you better.

00:00:30.040 --> 00:00:32.320
I'll be riding you a lot today.

00:00:32.320 --> 00:00:36.430
After all, it's the Inter-High.

00:00:55.650 --> 00:00:58.160
<b><i>Yowamushi Pedal</i></b>

00:02:07.160 --> 00:02:09.980
<b>Kyoto
Kyoto Fushimi High School</b>

00:02:08.500 --> 00:02:13.000
<i>RIDE.17  Start!!!</i>

00:02:10.590 --> 00:02:12.380
It's already starting.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:16.190
Why is the masseuse riding, but I'm out?

00:02:16.430 --> 00:02:20.450
You have a lot of friends, 
don't you? That's why.

00:02:20.450 --> 00:02:21.420
What?

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:27.370
You told all your friends you'd 
be riding in the Inter-High.

00:02:27.370 --> 00:02:30.400
Of course I did. It's an honor.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:32.880
Everyone wants to ride in the Inter-High.

00:02:32.880 --> 00:02:41.890
<b>Hironishi</b>

00:02:33.210 --> 00:02:35.410
My tag is #116.

00:02:35.410 --> 00:02:37.950
You told me I was the sixth man.

00:02:37.950 --> 00:02:41.890
Because I knew you'd tell everyone.

00:02:42.220 --> 00:02:44.620
Everyone must've thought

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:49.640
this year's Kyoto Fushimi High School 
was so weak that even you made the cut.

00:02:50.800 --> 00:02:53.610
My parents came all the 
way from Kyoto to watch.

00:02:53.610 --> 00:02:55.010
My friends came to cheer me on, too.

00:02:55.010 --> 00:02:58.060
That's your own doing.

00:02:58.060 --> 00:03:00.280
This is strategy.

00:03:00.280 --> 00:03:01.030
Strat—

00:03:02.590 --> 00:03:05.780
Alternates can be subbed 
in at the last second.

00:03:05.780 --> 00:03:11.370
The system's designed to prevent sick 
or injured members from riding, but...

00:03:11.720 --> 00:03:12.920
I'm fine!

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:15.880
You're weaker than a Zaku.

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:20.140
You're always falling behind in practice.
You could never keep up.

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:25.970
Did you think you were strong 
enough to ride on my team?

00:03:26.580 --> 00:03:30.000
I thought I had some hidden 
talent or something.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:36.780
That's why you'll never be more than a Zaku.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:38.600
How naïve.

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:41.340
I'll use Komari-kun during the race.

00:03:41.340 --> 00:03:45.440
Your job is finished. Over.

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:47.370
Haven't I always told you?

00:03:49.690 --> 00:03:54.330
Keep your trump cards until the end.

00:03:54.330 --> 00:03:54.730
<b>Message Received</b>

00:03:54.730 --> 00:03:57.090
<b>Fight!</b>

00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:02.260
Hironishi seemed depressed.

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:04.650
Did you know he'd be kicked off the team?

00:04:05.120 --> 00:04:05.930
No.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:10.640
Anyway, all Komari ever 
does is massage people.

00:04:11.610 --> 00:04:14.510
Can he really ride a bike?

00:04:24.920 --> 00:04:26.750
He's fast.

00:04:26.750 --> 00:04:28.370
His form is beautiful, too.

00:04:28.370 --> 00:04:31.300
Yeah. Wait, this is no time for that.

00:04:31.300 --> 00:04:32.810
He's our opponent, too.

00:04:32.810 --> 00:04:36.520
Kyoto Fushimi High School 
seemed like an army last year,

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:37.880
but now they've got guys like him.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.560
The way he rides is rhythmical.

00:04:40.560 --> 00:04:43.890
It's like he's been set loose.

00:04:45.610 --> 00:04:48.720
<i>The 1.5 kilometer road encircling 
the Inter-High grounds...</i>

00:04:49.170 --> 00:04:51.120
<i>Participants are using it to warm up.</i>

00:04:51.750 --> 00:04:54.390
<i>He must be among them.</i>

00:04:56.820 --> 00:04:58.810
Anyway, I feel great.

00:04:58.810 --> 00:05:02.810
I think I'll be able to hear 
plenty of your voice today.

00:05:07.060 --> 00:05:07.820
There he is!

00:05:08.400 --> 00:05:11.180
<i>Calm down. The race hasn't started yet.</i>

00:05:11.180 --> 00:05:14.120
<i>Approach quietly. Quietly.</i>

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:17.420
<i>Quietly approach him and nonchalantly touch him.</i>

00:05:18.300 --> 00:05:23.040
I'm honored you invited me 
to ride with you, Imaizumi.

00:05:23.040 --> 00:05:25.280
I know you're just warming up,

00:05:25.280 --> 00:05:29.560
but I can't believe we're riding 
together at the Inter-High grounds.

00:05:29.560 --> 00:05:31.260
It could've been anyone.

00:05:31.260 --> 00:05:32.010
What?

00:05:32.410 --> 00:05:36.270
Teshima-san said it wouldn't be good if 
something happened while I was riding alone,

00:05:36.270 --> 00:05:37.900
so he told me to go with someone.

00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:41.950
Y-You're right. Problems can be difficult 
to handle when you're riding alone.

00:05:41.950 --> 00:05:44.800
You can count on me.
Problems are something I've—

00:05:44.800 --> 00:05:46.750
You seemed the least busy.

00:05:46.750 --> 00:05:48.220
What?

00:05:48.780 --> 00:05:50.330
It's still an honor, though.

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:53.870
Sugimoto Terufumi has never been 
more honored in his life, Imaizumi.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:58.620
You chose me during a time as important 
as just before the Inter-High.

00:05:58.620 --> 00:06:01.540
You're strong, Imaizumi.

00:06:02.450 --> 00:06:09.210
Sometimes, I think about the amazing guys 
on our team, including Naruko and Onoda.

00:06:09.210 --> 00:06:11.800
On top of that, we're in the same class.

00:06:12.220 --> 00:06:14.850
It must be a miracle.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:21.700
Since I lost to Kaburagi that day, 
I can't ride in the Inter-High.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:26.150
But during that first-year race, 
you told me to hold my head high.

00:06:26.890 --> 00:06:30.540
I failed to accomplish anything, but rather 
than scolding me, that's what you said.

00:06:31.120 --> 00:06:33.450
I've been thinking since that day.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:38.240
I worked hard because I was 
influenced by you and Onoda.

00:06:38.240 --> 00:06:45.870
Maybe, just maybe my riding—
and this may be brazen of me—

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:50.080
But maybe I'm influencing you 
and Onoda just a little bit.

00:06:51.260 --> 00:06:55.820
It builds up over time.
This warm up could be part of it.

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:58.810
And if it helps you during the Inter-High...

00:06:59.310 --> 00:07:01.180
Then I have no regrets.

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:03.380
I'm proud of myself.

00:07:04.370 --> 00:07:07.280
Go ride your heart out, Imaizumi.

00:07:08.920 --> 00:07:10.940
That hurts. Where did that come from?

00:07:10.940 --> 00:07:13.010
Huh? What?

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.290
Sorry. I guess you could say it's my dream.

00:07:15.290 --> 00:07:17.790
I got carried away.

00:07:17.790 --> 00:07:19.640
I'm joking.

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:23.060
You've definitely moved me.

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:23.580
What?

00:07:24.660 --> 00:07:26.340
You can count on me.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:31.590
<i>Kyoto Fushimi High School? 
I didn't notice him.</i>

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.920
Imaizumi!

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.840
You're Imaizumi-san.

00:07:45.840 --> 00:07:48.100
I heard you did a lot last year.

00:07:48.100 --> 00:07:49.700
I've heard about you.

00:07:50.320 --> 00:07:52.210
I'm glad we got to meet.

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:56.720
<i>Has this guy always been on the 
Kyoto Fushimi High School team?</i>

00:07:56.720 --> 00:07:57.610
<i>Is he a first-year?</i>

00:07:57.610 --> 00:08:01.410
I'm sorry. I was so delighted, 
I lost my balance.

00:08:02.160 --> 00:08:05.300
<i>I let out a moan. His muscles are nice.</i>

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:06.290
<i>But...</i>

00:08:06.970 --> 00:08:08.750
Are you not feeling well?

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:13.720
Wh-What's wrong with you? Imaizumi's 
always in perfect shape.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.720
How rude.

00:08:16.130 --> 00:08:17.970
It was rough.

00:08:18.630 --> 00:08:20.890
Am I right?

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:23.100
I told you...

00:08:23.100 --> 00:08:24.620
See you at the starting line.

00:08:25.490 --> 00:08:27.060
Hey, you're running? Hey!

00:08:27.560 --> 00:08:28.920
Hey!

00:08:31.300 --> 00:08:33.320
<i>The race will start in thirty minutes.</i>

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.320
<i>All riders, please get ready.</i>

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:41.620
<i>Access to the course will 
be restricted in fifteen minutes.</i>

00:08:39.800 --> 00:08:42.730
I'm here to cheer you on.

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:44.160
Higashido!

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:45.610
This is for you.

00:08:44.160 --> 00:08:47.880
<b>Chiba
Sohoku High School</b>

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:47.880
Thanks. Did you come from Chiba?

00:08:48.280 --> 00:08:49.220
Yeah.

00:08:49.800 --> 00:08:51.130
But don't you...

00:08:51.540 --> 00:08:53.820
The volleyball team lost.

00:08:53.820 --> 00:08:58.650
We made it pretty far, but we were 
still a long way from nationals.

00:08:58.650 --> 00:09:00.060
I see.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.200
I'm jealous.

00:09:03.560 --> 00:09:07.200
That you get to fight at nationals, 
and in your final, third year.

00:09:08.100 --> 00:09:10.980
My time in a club is over.

00:09:11.810 --> 00:09:13.320
Good luck, Teshima.

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:15.530
You're a star.

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:21.130
I quit the Minami Middle School bicycle club 
we rode in to join the volleyball club.

00:09:21.580 --> 00:09:23.000
You kept riding.

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:27.420
It must've been hard to become a 
regular on a team that won nationals.

00:09:27.910 --> 00:09:31.220
But you bounced back. It's amazing.

00:09:31.940 --> 00:09:33.610
Don't feel bad about it.

00:09:33.610 --> 00:09:39.800
I know you haven't accomplished much,
but I believe from the bottom of my heart...

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:43.430
You're the star of Minami Middle School.

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:49.160
You can tell me that once 
I accomplish something.

00:09:49.160 --> 00:09:53.280
<i>The race will begin in fifteen minutes. 
The course is now closed.</i>

00:09:51.950 --> 00:09:54.770
Sorry, it's nearly time. I'm going.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:55.830
<i>All riders, please get ready.</i>

00:09:54.770 --> 00:09:57.650
Sure. Sorry to have bothered 
you when you're so busy.

00:09:59.110 --> 00:10:01.430
It's been a while, Jun-chan.

00:10:01.990 --> 00:10:04.710
No, Teshima-kun.

00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:09.630
I thought I'd come say hi 
before the race started.

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:11.160
He's huge.

00:10:11.160 --> 00:10:12.100
Shikiba...

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:15.260
What? That's Ashikiba?

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:17.610
Well, if it isn't Ashikiba.

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:19.910
Man, it's been a while.

00:10:20.360 --> 00:10:23.930
It's me. We rode together on the 
Minami Middle School bicycle team.

00:10:23.930 --> 00:10:27.020
This brings back memories. 
You're still riding?

00:10:27.950 --> 00:10:30.690
Hako... Hakone Academy High School?

00:10:31.120 --> 00:10:33.170
That Hakone Academy High School?

00:10:33.170 --> 00:10:35.240
Isn't that place super strong?

00:10:35.240 --> 00:10:36.900
You're a regular there?

00:10:37.860 --> 00:10:39.960
Sorry, who are you?

00:10:42.390 --> 00:10:46.050
It's Higashido. My nickname was Higashimaru.

00:10:46.050 --> 00:10:49.270
Remember when your saddle 
fell off during practice?

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:50.680
I fixed it for you.

00:10:50.680 --> 00:10:52.750
Oh, that Machida-kun.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:55.590
Yeah—no, not Machida.

00:10:55.590 --> 00:10:58.070
He barely ever came to practice.

00:10:58.070 --> 00:10:59.540
Oh, Machida-kun.

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:00.830
This brings back memories.

00:11:00.830 --> 00:11:02.930
You haven't changed, Machida-kun.

00:11:02.930 --> 00:11:06.180
You remembered my name completely wrong.

00:11:06.810 --> 00:11:09.100
Well, whatever. As long as you remember me.

00:11:09.630 --> 00:11:10.350
Shikiba...

00:11:11.810 --> 00:11:15.730
Come here. Let's take a picture together.

00:11:16.880 --> 00:11:22.150
Sorry, Machida-kun. Since we're 
enemies, I can't go any closer.

00:11:24.380 --> 00:11:28.620
Overthrowing Sohoku High School is our mission.

00:11:28.620 --> 00:11:31.540
<i>Oh, right. Last year,
Hakone Academy High School...</i>

00:11:32.790 --> 00:11:34.040
I'll beat you.

00:11:34.810 --> 00:11:36.520
That's all I came to say.

00:11:37.450 --> 00:11:38.450
I see.

00:11:39.670 --> 00:11:42.760
Jun-chan, you said we'd 
conquer the world together.

00:11:45.800 --> 00:11:51.880
But sorry. Only one of us 
can win at this Inter-High.

00:11:52.980 --> 00:11:54.440
We can't do it together.

00:11:57.830 --> 00:12:00.900
I guess not, since we're on different teams.

00:12:01.880 --> 00:12:03.380
It'll be Hakone Academy High School.

00:12:03.380 --> 00:12:05.370
I can't allow that.

00:12:07.410 --> 00:12:09.750
Good luck to both of us.

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:17.630
I can't accept something from an enemy.

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:23.440
You were nice to me.
You taught me how to ride a bike.

00:12:23.440 --> 00:12:28.180
But the seniors at Hakone Academy High School,
who have graduated now,

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:31.730
taught me how to become stronger
 and where I belonged.

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:37.440
So I'm going to help this team win this year.

00:12:38.110 --> 00:12:38.800
Bye.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:41.890
Hey, wait. Ashikiba!

00:12:41.890 --> 00:12:43.200
Oh, right.

00:12:43.200 --> 00:12:48.200
<b>Inter-High
Bicycle Race
 Program</b>

00:12:43.980 --> 00:12:46.280
This year, our sixth man is incredible.

00:12:47.120 --> 00:12:51.330
Unfortunately, Sohoku High School's 
steady advance won't continue.

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:54.370
Following Manami last year,

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:57.780
he's Hakone Academy High School's 
second ever first-year member.

00:12:58.480 --> 00:13:01.130
He's #16.

00:13:09.670 --> 00:13:12.710
Hey, Yuto. How long are you going 
to keep riding that roller?

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:14.310
We've already been called to the starting line.

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:17.040
Oh, Takadajou-san. Seriously?

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:19.230
Kuroda-senpai's on edge.

00:13:19.230 --> 00:13:22.560
You're just too relaxed.

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.950
That doesn't sound good.

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:27.610
I brought Yuto.

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:30.920
What were you doing?

00:13:30.920 --> 00:13:34.210
Sorry, I got caught up in riding a roller.

00:13:34.210 --> 00:13:37.980
You're late. And why do you 
always wear that weird mask?

00:13:39.360 --> 00:13:43.760
It's cute, right? I kinda 
want to be a little girl.

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:45.760
I like it. I have three of them.

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:50.600
What are you, a dreamy-eyed girl? Get ready.

00:13:50.600 --> 00:13:52.140
Okay.

00:13:52.730 --> 00:13:56.270
<i>He's easygoing and full of confidence.</i>

00:13:56.270 --> 00:13:59.400
<i>In that way, he's sort of like him.</i>

00:13:59.980 --> 00:14:01.440
Let's go, Yuto.

00:14:02.570 --> 00:14:05.570
<b>Inter-High
Road Race</b>

00:14:03.070 --> 00:14:07.450
This is the Inter-High you 
said you wanted to come to...

00:14:07.860 --> 00:14:09.200
Shinkai Yuto.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:14.100
The atmosphere and fans are awesome.

00:14:14.100 --> 00:14:15.540
It makes my heart skip a beat.

00:14:19.550 --> 00:14:23.840
Izumida-san, didn't you ride 
with my brother last year?

00:14:23.840 --> 00:14:25.760
How was Hayato-kun?

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:30.430
He was fast and unbelievably beautiful.

00:14:31.020 --> 00:14:33.850
No one was better suited to wear tag #4.

00:14:33.850 --> 00:14:36.670
Oh, really?

00:14:36.670 --> 00:14:40.060
I've never really ridden with him,
so I wouldn't know.

00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:42.900
After all, I'm a climber.

00:14:43.690 --> 00:14:47.860
It's starting!

00:14:48.750 --> 00:14:51.980
The Inter-High is starting soon.

00:14:51.980 --> 00:14:54.780
Twenty more minutes. What am I going to do?

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.780
Onoda-san...

00:14:54.780 --> 00:14:58.380
Your #1 is freaking out. Will he be okay?

00:14:58.380 --> 00:14:59.370
You're right.

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:06.510
O-Okay, I've calmed down.

00:15:06.510 --> 00:15:07.700
I'm calm.

00:15:07.700 --> 00:15:09.510
Are you okay? Here's a towel.

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:10.750
Yeah, I'm fine.

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:11.720
Yeah, I'm great.

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:12.700
Onoda-kun...

00:15:12.700 --> 00:15:13.220
Yes?

00:15:13.220 --> 00:15:15.640
Your socks don't match.

00:15:18.560 --> 00:15:21.520
<i>It's my second time. My second Inter-High...</i>

00:15:22.550 --> 00:15:24.520
<i>Will I be able to ride well?</i>

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:27.830
<i>While wearing the most impressive number tag,</i>

00:15:27.830 --> 00:15:33.280
<i>will I be able to ride well,
like I did last year?</i>

00:15:34.020 --> 00:15:38.290
<i>Ride well? How do I do that?</i>

00:15:41.160 --> 00:15:43.000
Second time pressure?

00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:45.940
That's right. He's a serious man.

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:48.690
There's no telling how much 
pressure he's feeling from how

00:15:48.690 --> 00:15:50.550
he performed at the last Inter-High.

00:15:50.860 --> 00:15:54.270
Not only that, but he won. He took first.

00:15:54.270 --> 00:15:56.320
The expectations of those 
around him skyrocketed.

00:15:56.930 --> 00:15:59.060
He must be feeling it.

00:15:59.690 --> 00:16:02.690
I tried to keep it from 
bothering him, though.

00:16:03.940 --> 00:16:07.420
The first time you can ride freely 
because everything is new.

00:16:08.320 --> 00:16:09.860
But the second time...

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:13.450
Doing the same thing twice 
is a herculean task.

00:16:14.740 --> 00:16:19.220
If Onoda's mental condition hasn't 
recovered by the time the race starts,

00:16:19.220 --> 00:16:20.250
then Sohoku High School...

00:16:22.070 --> 00:16:24.250
That's all, Kimitaka?

00:16:26.000 --> 00:16:27.880
You said you wanted to talk.

00:16:27.880 --> 00:16:29.020
Aoyagi...

00:16:29.020 --> 00:16:31.550
It's simple. I know.

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:35.800
You didn't know, Kimitaka? He's...

00:16:36.870 --> 00:16:42.220
<i>The bearer of tag #1 has arrived, 
Sohoku High School's Onoda Sakamichi.</i>

00:16:42.220 --> 00:16:44.280
Onoda, do it again this year!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:46.980
<i>He's being escorted to the course by 
second-years Naruko-kun and Imaizumi-kun.</i>

00:16:45.250 --> 00:16:47.500
Onoda-kun is so cute!

00:16:52.510 --> 00:16:53.790
<i>This isn't good.</i>

00:16:53.790 --> 00:16:54.780
<i>He's hopeless.</i>

00:16:57.970 --> 00:17:01.040
I can finally get in line 
and take a breather.

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.920
Nah, we're in the front.

00:17:03.920 --> 00:17:06.420
We were last year's winning team.

00:17:06.420 --> 00:17:08.170
Huh? What?

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.290
You've got this!

00:17:16.290 --> 00:17:17.720
Show us again this year!

00:17:18.090 --> 00:17:20.630
I can't handle being the center of attention.

00:17:20.630 --> 00:17:24.380
You can't tell them not 
to look at you up here.

00:17:24.380 --> 00:17:26.060
There are plenty of cameras here, too.

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:29.510
What kind of call was that?

00:17:29.510 --> 00:17:31.650
What does it mean?

00:17:33.110 --> 00:17:34.360
You're awful.

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:36.500
That can't be good.

00:17:36.500 --> 00:17:38.610
Onoda-kun's shaking.

00:17:38.610 --> 00:17:40.600
Should I jump in there and pop him one?

00:17:40.600 --> 00:17:43.050
The pain might knock the tension out of him.

00:17:43.520 --> 00:17:46.260
We can't go inside since 
the race is starting.

00:17:46.260 --> 00:17:49.750
What are we going to do
about him, then? He's #1.

00:17:50.400 --> 00:17:52.980
<i>Calm down. Calm down.</i>

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:54.800
<i>Calm down, calm down...</i>

00:17:55.510 --> 00:17:58.230
<i>It's no use. I can't stop shaking.</i>

00:17:58.230 --> 00:18:01.280
<i>I can't feel my hands. What should I do?</i>

00:18:01.970 --> 00:18:05.190
<i>How do I ride a bike?</i>

00:18:05.630 --> 00:18:08.280
<i>I have to do something. I'm #1.</i>

00:18:08.280 --> 00:18:12.660
<i>I'm #1! I have to do something myself...</i>

00:18:15.140 --> 00:18:16.280
Aoyagi-san...

00:18:16.280 --> 00:18:17.490
Just one punch.

00:18:20.030 --> 00:18:21.620
Are you trying to relax?

00:18:21.620 --> 00:18:22.580
Um, I...

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:25.700
Yes.

00:18:26.530 --> 00:18:29.290
Then I have one thing to say to you.

00:18:30.380 --> 00:18:31.420
Okay.

00:18:32.140 --> 00:18:35.390
I learned a lot from Tadokoro-san.

00:18:35.390 --> 00:18:37.870
How to ride. How to race.

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:39.300
How to endure.

00:18:39.300 --> 00:18:41.930
Etiquette and greetings. How to eat.

00:18:42.750 --> 00:18:46.100
The will to win. The importance 
of aiming for the finish line.

00:18:47.180 --> 00:18:49.000
It's not just things he taught me.

00:18:49.000 --> 00:18:51.900
I learned a lot from watching him, too.

00:18:52.520 --> 00:18:54.770
What did you learn from Makishima-san?

00:18:54.770 --> 00:18:58.580
I... I... I, uh...

00:18:58.580 --> 00:19:00.420
It may be hard to put into words,

00:19:00.420 --> 00:19:03.580
but there should be a lot of 
things you learned from him.

00:19:14.860 --> 00:19:18.720
It should be flowing through 
the veins inside your body.

00:19:20.850 --> 00:19:23.420
Think you can't do what you did last year?

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:25.220
Of course not.

00:19:25.960 --> 00:19:28.310
Because you've gotten stronger.

00:19:28.310 --> 00:19:30.520
You bear the souls of our seniors.

00:19:32.020 --> 00:19:35.440
Sohoku High School is a team 
that supports one another.

00:19:35.440 --> 00:19:38.030
It applies to races, but that's not all.

00:19:38.390 --> 00:19:40.230
You're a second-year now.

00:19:40.230 --> 00:19:43.030
That's the most different thing about you.

00:19:43.030 --> 00:19:46.030
There's going to be a 
first-year riding this year.

00:19:46.360 --> 00:19:48.300
Carry on their legacy. Teach him.

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:49.840
Show him with your riding.

00:19:49.840 --> 00:19:52.040
Show him everything you have in this race.

00:19:52.440 --> 00:19:56.290
Then Kaburagi will pass it 
on to the next generation.

00:19:56.290 --> 00:19:58.540
Sohoku High School will become even stronger.

00:19:59.050 --> 00:20:00.690
<i>The next generation...</i>

00:20:02.000 --> 00:20:03.470
Become stronger.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:07.010
<i>He's right. I've already received something.</i>

00:20:07.010 --> 00:20:10.480
<i>I'm holding so many things inside this hand.</i>

00:20:11.030 --> 00:20:12.670
<i>The courage to take the first step...</i>

00:20:12.670 --> 00:20:14.480
<i>Friends who support me...</i>

00:20:14.480 --> 00:20:18.690
We're counting on you to 
carry our Sohoku, Sakamichi.

00:20:20.780 --> 00:20:22.570
Got it.

00:20:23.310 --> 00:20:25.780
<i>I'll make Sohoku High School stronger.</i>

00:20:26.910 --> 00:20:27.620
Guys!

00:20:30.070 --> 00:20:31.580
<i>Aoyagi...</i>

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:32.960
<i>I see.</i>

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:37.070
It's simple. I'll give him a job.

00:20:37.070 --> 00:20:38.420
A job?

00:20:38.910 --> 00:20:41.650
I'll narrow down what he 
has to do to one thing.

00:20:42.110 --> 00:20:44.800
That will make him strong.

00:20:45.810 --> 00:20:47.430
Climb past 100 guys!

00:20:47.840 --> 00:20:53.480
He already has the mindset 
to charge straight ahead.

00:20:54.370 --> 00:20:58.150
<i>Aoyagi Hajime, you're unbelievable.</i>

00:20:59.280 --> 00:21:00.190
Let's go!

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:00.940
Yeah!

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:02.740
I've been waiting for this!

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:05.780
I was going to do that. 
Don't take that from me!

00:21:07.490 --> 00:21:09.280
We are one!

00:21:09.740 --> 00:21:11.120
Yeah!

00:21:13.120 --> 00:21:15.350
Wow, it's starting to heat up.

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:17.580
This year's Inter-High 
should be on fire, too.

00:21:18.360 --> 00:21:20.300
It's time!

00:21:18.670 --> 00:21:20.840
<i>The race will begin shortly.</i>

00:21:22.320 --> 00:21:23.460
It's starting!

00:21:24.260 --> 00:21:25.540
<i>The hot sun...</i>

00:21:25.540 --> 00:21:26.790
<i>Ten seconds.</i>

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:27.690
<i>The cheers...</i>

00:21:27.690 --> 00:21:31.140
<i>Nine, eight, seven...</i>

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:31.140
<i>I can practically hear their heartbeats.</i>

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:36.050
<i>Six, five, four...</i>

00:21:33.370 --> 00:21:37.270
<i>It's starting. The white-hot race...</i>

00:21:36.050 --> 00:21:39.940
<i>Three, two, one!</i>

00:21:37.920 --> 00:21:39.180
<i>The Inter-High!</i>

00:23:14.870 --> 00:23:17.710
I wonder how many will 
remain after this year's.

00:23:17.710 --> 00:23:19.040
Who knows?

00:23:19.040 --> 00:23:21.830
Sakurai is a second-year. 
He's riding with Aoyagi.

00:23:21.830 --> 00:23:23.780
Th-Thank you.

00:23:23.780 --> 00:23:26.370
Sugimoto is a second-year. 
He's riding with Teshima.

00:23:26.370 --> 00:23:27.490
Hey.

00:23:27.490 --> 00:23:29.010
Thank you.

00:23:30.940 --> 00:23:33.670
This is the strongest 
lineup I've come up with.

00:23:36.450 --> 00:23:39.890
<i>NEXT RIDE  The Swelling Aoyagi</i>

00:23:39.890 --> 00:23:44.900
This is a work of fiction. All characters and organizations
 appearing in this work are fictional. In this work,
 characters sometimes engage in dangerous activities.
 While riding bicycles on actual roads,
 please follow all traffic laws and ride safely.

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:51.000
<b><i>The high cadence
 continues!!</i></b>
